83 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 52 0 R/T(Problem Statement Millions of skilled workers in India struggle to find consistent work due to lack of digital access, poor visibility, and dependence on middlemen. At the same time, people and businesses find it difficult to hire verified, nearby service providers. Most platforms today focus only on urban or white-collar jobs, leaving skilled trade workers behind. There\220s a clear gap between skill availability and service demand. SkillBridge aims to bridge this gap with a smart, AI-powered platform that connects skilled individuals directly with real job opportunities.)/E(Problem Statement Millions of skilled workers in India struggle to find consistent work due to lack of digital access, poor visibility, and dependence on middlemen. At the same time, people and businesses find it difficult to hire verified, nearby service providers. Most platforms today focus only on urban or white-collar jobs, leaving skilled trade workers behind. There\220s a clear gap between skill availability and service demand. SkillBridge aims to bridge this gap with a smart, AI-powered platform that connects skilled individuals directly with real job opportunities.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

